<p><strong>Step 2: Vibe-code a clickable mock.</strong> In an afternoon I vibe-coded a clickable dashboard mock: a panel for the relationship graph, a panel for current state, a panel for authority. I did not read the generated code and did not care that it was held together with tape. I just needed to see stuff, click stuff, and put it in front of early users to watch which panel they reached for first.</p>
