<p style="font-family:var(--font-ui);font-weight:600;">Take the product or feature you are building right now. Write out all eleven layers from UI down to QA, and for each one note in a sentence what exists today and what you have actually tested. Then circle the lowest layer that is empty or untested, that is the layer you are about to skip, and write the first concrete step to build it before you touch the surface again.</p>
