<p>Once you have built the lowest empty layer, put the product under deliberate load, more requests and more concurrent users than your demo, and watch your monitoring. If a layer breaks, it just broke for you in private, which is the only place you ever want it to break. Many a polished app has broken in public. Yours should not.</p>
